azy adventure game: the most important words in your writings are decided by roulette.","steam_appid":3658860,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"support@wakuwakugames.com"},"supported_languages":"Japanese","type":"demo","website":"https://www.wakuwakugames.com/ghostwriterworkshop"}